{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24611","headline":"宴後题府中水堂赠卢尹中丞 · 白居易","name":"宴後题府中水堂赠卢尹中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水斋岁久渐荒芜，自媿甘棠无一株。\n新酒客来方宴饮，旧堂主在重欢娱。\n莫言杨柳枝空老，直致樱桃树已枯。\n从我到君十一尹，相看自置府来无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24611.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24611","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}